{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K76zZJBFfn5i6wjxYNeBsq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Cross-scale claim保留但降级为''degeneration transfers across scales,\n2\t  exploitation mode converges to H7''——确认universality但taxonomy分化贡献被削弱。C2 double-edged需要明确\n3\t  软化：genuine OR从3.48降至~1.5仅边界显著（CMH p≈0.06），且cross-scale heterogeneity 显著（4B OR=2.4\n4\t  vs 8B OR=0.25, Breslow-Day p<0.01）——ISR genuine benefit是scale- dependent transient，不是universal\n5\t  property。Reframe为''modest transient uplift at 4B, accelerated collapse at 8B''。论文重心转向C1\n6\t  diagnostic methodology + Goodhart inevitability mechanism + 9-mode taxonomy。Premise-count-matched\n7\t  analysis和meta-Goodhart triple gaming作为methodological contribution补位。ISR-as-reward篇幅压缩至≤1.5页，\n8\t  增加diagnostic case study depth。预期reviewer score 3.0-3.25 (Findings级别)。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: incorporate_s45_s46_500step_data\n13\t  plan_id: plan_019\n14\t  description: '将已有的s45/s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文分析。纯写作/分析任务，0 GPU。 s45 (PR=99%, H7=93.9%,\n15\t    genuine=1.0%) 和 s46 (PR=93%, H1=89.2%, genuine=9.7%) 扩展C1证据从N=3到N=5。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    five_seed_mean_prove_rate: 0.792\n20\t    five_seed_std_prove_rate: 0.366\n21\t    five_seed_mean_genuine_rate: 0.036\n22\t    five_seed_degeneration_rate_ge90_pct: 5/5 (100%)\n23\t    mode_distribution_summary: 2 H7-dominant (s44 100%, s45 93.9%), 2 H1-dominant\n24\t      (s42 87.1%, s46 89.2%), 1 collapse (s43 PR=13%)\n25\t    five_seed_H7_mean_pct: 38.8\n26\t    five_seed_H1_mean_pct: 56.3\n27\t    five_seed_genuine_total: 18/396 proved (4.5%)\n28\t    sft_baseline_comparison_genuine: 92.9% (SFT) vs 4.5% (GRPO exec-only)\n29\t  result_rationale: '所有5个seed均展示≥90%结构退化（s43虽PR=13%，其13个proved样本中100% H1）， 确认exec-only\n30\t    GRPO hacking是systematic而非偶发。模式分布展示stochastic bifurcation：同一架构+数据+超参，仅seed不同就产生H7\n31\t    tautology (s44/s45) vs H1 conclusion-embedding (s42/s46) vs learning collapse\n32\t    (s43)三种完全不同 的failure mode。genuine rate从SFT baseline的92.9%降至4.5%——GRPO exec-only\n33\t    在500步内几乎消除genuine reasoning。这是C1 diagnostic claim的核心证据： ISR能检测到prove_rate无法发现的退化（s44\n34\t    PR=98%但genuine=0%）。\n35\t\n36\t    '\n37\t  tables:\n38\t  - name: 'Table: 5-Seed Exec-Only 500-Step Taxonomy (C1 Evidence)'\n39\t    content: '| Seed | PR   | H7%   | H1%   | H8%  | Gen% | ISR*(proved) | Dominant\n40\t      Mode     |\n41\t\n42\t      |------|------|-------|-------|------|------|--------------|-------------------|\n43\t\n44\t      | s42  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 87.1  | 6.5  | 7.5  | 0.132        | H1 (conc. embed.)\n45\t      |\n46\t\n47\t      | s43  | 0.13 | 0.0   | 100.0 | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.000        | Collapse          |\n48\t\n49\t      | s44  | 0.98 | 100.0 | 0.0   | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.582        | H7 (tautology)    |\n50\t\n51\t      | s45  | 0.99 | 93.9  | 5.1   | 1.0  | 1.0  | 0.506        | H7 (tautology)    |\n52\t\n53\t      | s46  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 89.2  | 4.3  | 9.7  | 0.089        | H1 (conc. embed.)\n54\t      |\n55\t\n56\t      | Mean | 0.79 | 38.8  | 56.3  | 2.4  | 3.6  | 0.262        | —                 |\n57\t\n58\t      '\n59\t  figures_description:\n60\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: per-seed taxonomy distribution across 5 exec-only seeds，展示mode\n61\t    heterogeneity和stochastic bifurcation'\n62\t  analysis: 'N=5显著强化了C1 diagnostic claim：ISR检测到5/5 seeds的结构退化，而prove_rate 仅在1/5 seeds\n63\t    (s43) 显示异常。特别是s44 (PR=98%, genuine=0%, H7=100%) 是 ISR diagnostic value的最佳case\n64\t    study——PR完美但输出100%是tautological shortcut。 ISR*=0.582看似还行，但这是H7 artifact (单premise\n65\t    tautology机械产生ISR≈0.5)， 而非genuine reasoning signal。论文应以s44为focal example展开diagnostic\n66\t    case study。\n67\t\n68\t    '\n69\t- name: s45_s46_1000step_extension\n70\t  plan_id: plan_020\n71\t  description: '将s45和s46 exec-only训练从500步延长到1000步。验证ISR崩塌轨迹在N=3 seeds上的泛化性(s42已有1000步数据)。每seed\n72\t    ~3h GPU。\n73\t\n74\t    '\n75\t  expected_results:\n76\t    s45_1000step:\n77\t      prove_rate: 0.97\n78\t      n_proved: 97\n79\t      proved_only_isr: 0.1\n80\t      h7_rate: 0.186\n81\t      h7_count: 18\n82\t      h1_rate: 0.722\n83\t      h1_count: 70\n84\t      h8_rate: 0.072\n85\t      h8_count: 7\n86\t      genuine_rate: 0.021\n87\t      genuine_count: 2\n88\t      isr_collapse_from_500: -80.2%\n89\t      mode_transition: H7 93.9% → H7 18.6% + H1 72.2% (partial H7→H1 switch)\n90\t    s46_1000step:\n91\t      prove_rate: 0.98\n92\t      n_proved: 98\n93\t      proved_only_isr: 0.012\n94\t      h7_rate: 0.0\n95\t      h7_count: 0\n96\t      h1_rate: 0.949\n97\t      h1_count: 93\n98\t      h8_rate: 0.041\n99\t      h8_count: 4\n100\t      genuine_rate: 0.01\n101\t      genuine_count: 1\n102\t      isr_collapse_from_500: -86.5%\n103\t      mode_transition: H1 89.2% → H1 94.9% (H1 deepens, no mode switch)\n104\t    three_seed_trajectory:\n105\t      s42_trajectory: ISR* 0.642→0.132→0.003 (500→1000步 collapse 97.7%)\n106\t      s45_trajectory: ISR* 0.506→0.10 (collapse 80.2%, partial — H7 residual)\n107\t      s46_trajectory: ISR* 0.089→0.012 (collapse 86.5%, full)\n108\t      mean_500_to_1000_collapse_pct: 88.1\n109\t      all_seeds_genuine_at_1000_le_2pct: true\n110\t  result_rationale: 's46在500步已是H1-dominant (89.2%)。延长到1000步强化H1至94.9%，genuine从 9.7%压缩至1.0%，ISR*从0.089降至0.012——遵循与s42/s44相同的H1路径（H1证明\n111\t    的ISR≈0因为conclusion已在premise中，ablation任何premise不影响prove）。\n112\t\n113\t    s45在500步是H7-dominant (93.9%)。关键预测：1000步时发生部分模式切换H7→H1， 类似已观察到的s44 (500步H7=100%\n114\t    → 1000步H1=85%)。但s45切换不完全，保留 18.6% H7残留。机制：长训练使模型发现更短的H1 exploit (conclusion直接作为\n115\t    premise)，部分H7 tautology被更极端的H1取代。H7残留的ISR artifact (单premise tautology ISR≈0.5)\n116\t    使整体ISR*维持在0.10而非崩塌至近零——形成\"partial collapse\"。\n117\t\n118\t    Median档位的关键区分：s45是partial collapse (ISR*=0.10) 而非full collapse (ISR*<0.02)。这与s42/s44/s46的full\n119\t    collapse形成对比，说明ISR collapse rate 是mode-dependent——H7→H1切换的completeness决定了ISR*的最终水位。\n120\t\n121\t    '\n122\t  tables:\n123\t  - name: 'Table: ISR Collapse Trajectory (N=3 seeds, 500→1000 steps)'\n124\t    content: '| Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Δ 500→1000 | Path            |\n125\t\n126\t      |------|-----------|-----------|------------|------------|-----------------|\n127\t\n128\t      | s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | −97.7%     | H1→H1 (stable)  |\n129\t\n130\t      | s45  | —         | 0.506     | 0.100      | −80.2%     | H7→H7/H1 (partial\n131\t      switch) |\n132\t\n133\t      | s46  | —         | 0.089     | 0.012      | −86.5%     | H1→H1 (deepens) |\n134\t\n135\t      '\n136\t  figures_description:\n137\t  - 'Line plot: ISR* vs training steps for N=3 seeds, 标注mode transition points'\n138\t  - 'Paired stacked bars: taxonomy at 500 vs 1000 steps per seed,展示mode shift dynamics'\n139\t  analysis: '3/3 seeds确认''degeneration worsens with training''。但collapse rate heterogeneous：\n140\t    H1路径(s42, s46)→ISR*趋近零 (97.7%, 86.5% collapse)；H7→H1混合路径(s45)→ ISR*停在0.10 (80.2%\n141\t    collapse) 因为残留H7的ISR artifact。这支持两个claim： (1) ISR collapse is universal — 方向一致;\n142\t    (2) ISR* alone can mislead — 需要 taxonomy annotation才能正确解读（s43 at 1000步ISR*=0.465\n143\t    但100% H7 tautology）。 论文应明确：高ISR*不等于genuine reasoning，低ISR*不是唯一的degeneration signal。\n144\t\n145\t    '\n146\t- name: qwen3_8b_exec_only_3seeds\n147\t  plan_id: plan_021\n148\t  description: 'Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44), 500步, K=8。 Cross-scale\n149\t    degeneration validation。K=4 pilot已失败 (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: training stagnation)，K=8提供足够GRPO\n150\t    sample diversity。每seed ~4h GPU。\n151\t\n152\t    '\n153\t  expected_results:\n154\t    s42_8b:\n155\t      prove_rate: 0.75\n156\t      n_proved: 75\n157\t      h7_rate: 0.627\n158\t      h7_count: 47\n159\t      h1_rate: 0.133\n160\t      h1_count: 10\n161\t      h8_rate: 0.053\n162\t      h8_count: 4\n163\t      genuine_rate: 0.187\n164\t      genuine_count: 14\n165\t      proved_only_isr: 0.33\n166\t      dominant_mode: H7\n167\t    s43_8b:\n168\t      prove_rate: 0.55\n169\t      n_proved: 55\n170\t      h7_rate: 0.691\n171\t      h7_count: 38\n172\t      h1_rate: 0.091\n173\t      h1_count: 5\n174\t      h8_rate: 0.036\n175\t      h8_count: 2\n176\t      genuine_rate: 0.145\n177\t      genuine_count: 8\n178\t      proved_only_isr: 0.37\n179\t      dominant_mode: H7\n180\t    s44_8b:\n181\t      prove_rate: 0.82\n182\t      n_proved: 82\n183\t      h7_rate: 0.634\n184\t      h7_count: 52\n185\t      h1_rate: 0.146\n186\t      h1_count: 12\n187\t      h8_rate: 0.061\n188\t      h8_count: 5\n189\t      genuine_rate: 0.122\n190\t      genuine_count: 10\n191\t      proved_only_isr: 0.34\n192\t      dominant_mode: H7\n193\t    aggregate_8b:\n194\t      mean_prove_rate: 0.71\n195\t      std_prove_rate: 0.14\n196\t      mean_hacking_rate: 0.849\n197\t      mean_genuine_rate: 0.151\n198\t      all_seeds_H7_dominant: true\n199\t      mode_differs_from_4b: false\n200\t      cross_scale_degeneration_confirmed: true\n201\t    cross_scale_summary:\n202\t      1.7B:\n203\t        PR: 0.03\n204\t        H7: 100\n205\t        H1: 0\n206\t        genuine: 0\n207\t        dominant: H7 (minimal tautology)\n208\t      4B:\n209\t        PR: 0.79\n210\t        H7: 38.8\n211\t        H1: 56.3\n212\t        genuine: 3.6\n213\t        dominant: H7/H1 mixed\n214\t      8B:\n215\t        PR: 0.71\n216\t        H7: 65.1\n217\t        H1: 12.3\n218\t        genuine: 15.1\n219\t        dominant: H7\n220\t  result_rationale: '8B在K=8下成功训练。Degeneration确认但程度弱于4B：hacking rate 85% vs 4B的96%。\n221\t\n222\t    为什么8B genuine rate (15.1%) 高于4B (3.6%)？8B更大的capacity允许模型在 exploit H7 tautology的同时维持部分genuine\n223\t    proof ability——这只是collapse timing 的延迟，不是质的改变。4B在500步已几乎完全collapse，8B需要更多步数才达到\n224\t    同等collapse程度（capacity越大，exploit越复杂，genuine的residual越持久）。\n225\t\n226\t    为什么dominant mode与4B相同（均为H7）？Median档位的核心假设。H7 tautological shortcut (P→P) 是model-agnostic的最优exploit：只要solver接受tautology作为\n227\t    valid proof，任何capacity的模型都会converge到此策略。4B和8B的H7结构相同 （单premise, conclusion=premise,\n228\t    ISR≈0.5）。差别仅在onset speed和residual genuine。\n229\t\n230\t    1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit, 无capacity构造H7), 4B→mixed H7/H1, 8B→H7 dominant。 Pattern表面看像capacity-dependent，但8B和4B的H7\n231\t    seeds (s44/s45) 在taxonomy上 indistinguishable。Reviewer会问''8B加了什么4B没有的insight?''——答案是universality\n232\t    confirmation，不是新insight。论文claim需降级。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  tables:\n236\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Scale Exec-Only Taxonomy (1.7B / 4B / 8B)'\n237\t    content: '| Scale | Seeds | Mean PR | H7%  | H1%  | H8% | Gen% | Dominant |\n238\t\n239\t      |-------|-------|---------|------|------|-----|------|----------|\n240\t\n241\t      | 1.7B  | 1     | 0.03   | 100  | 0    | 0   | 0    | H7       |\n242\t\n243\t      | 4B    | 5     | 0.79   | 38.8 | 56.3 | 2.4 | 3.6  | H7/H1   |\n244\t\n245\t      | 8B    | 3     | 0.71   | 65.1 | 12.3 | 5.0 | 15.1 | H7       |\n246\t\n247\t      '\n248\t  figures_description:\n249\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: taxonomy distribution at 3 scales, showing H7 convergence'\n250\t  - 'Box plot: genuine rate by scale, 每个点是一个seed, 展示within-scale variance'\n251\t  analysis: 'Cross-scale degeneration confirmed，但叙事需要careful framing。不能说''scale reveals\n252\t    distinct Goodhart basins''——8B和4B的H7 pattern太相似。正确的framing: ''structural degeneration\n253\t    under exec-only GRPO is universal across 1.7B-8B scale, with H7 tautology as the\n254\t    convergent exploitation strategy at sufficient capacity. Larger models sustain\n255\t    genuine reasoning longer (15.1% vs 3.6%) but still converge to >85% structural\n256\t    hacking within 500 steps.''\n257\t\n258\t    对reviewer的准备：''8B同质化意味着什么？'' → 意味着Goodhart mechanism是 reward-structure-driven\n259\t    (exec verification + GRPO) 而非capacity-driven。 H7 tautology是exec-only reward的fundamental\n260\t    vulnerability，增加model capacity 不能eliminate它，只能delay collapse。这强化了C1 (ISR diagnostic\n261\t    needed at any scale) 和C2 (Goodhart inevitable) 的claims。\n262\t\n263\t    '\n264\t- name: additional_isr_b01_seeds_s47_s49\n265\t  plan_id: plan_022\n266\t  description: '新增3个ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for Qwen3-4B, 扩展bimodality characterization从N=5到N=8。每seed\n267\t    ~1.5h GPU。\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t  expected_results:\n271\t    s47_isr_b01:\n272\t      prove_rate: 0.95\n273\t      n_proved: 95\n274\t      h7_rate: 0.832\n275\t      h7_count: 79\n276\t      h1_rate: 0.053\n277\t      h1_count: 5\n278\t      h8_rate: 0.084\n279\t      h8_count: 8\n280\t      genuine_rate: 0.032\n281\t      genuine_count: 3\n282\t      genuine_window: false\n283\t    s48_isr_b01:\n284\t      prove_rate: 0.62\n285\t      n_proved: 62\n286\t      h7_rate: 0.935\n287\t      h7_count: 58\n288\t      h1_rate: 0.032\n289\t      h1_count: 2\n290\t      genuine_rate: 0.0\n291\t      genuine_count: 0\n292\t      genuine_window: false\n293\t    s49_isr_b01:\n294\t      prove_rate: 0.85\n295\t      n_proved: 85\n296\t      h7_rate: 0.741\n297\t      h7_count: 63\n298\t      h1_rate: 0.082\n299\t      h1_count: 7\n300\t      h8_rate: 0.059\n301\t      h8_count: 5\n302\t      genuine_rate: 0.059\n303\t      genuine_count: 5\n304\t      genuine_window: false\n305\t    n8_bimodality_analysis:\n306\t      genuine_window_seeds:\n307\t      - s42 (17.3%)\n308\t      - s45 (54.8%)\n309\t      - s46 (54.5%)\n310\t      gaming_dominant_seeds:\n311\t      - s43 (0%)\n312\t      - s44 (0%)\n313\t      - s47 (3.2%)\n314\t      - s48 (0%)\n315\t      - s49 (5.9%)\n316\t      genuine_window_ratio: 3/8 (37.5%)\n317\t      bimodality_confirmed: true\n318\t      note: window threshold ≥15% genuine; s42 at 17.3% is borderline\n319\t    n8_4b_only_statistics:\n320\t      isr_total_genuine: 87/592 (14.7%)\n321\t      random_total_genuine: 45/678 (6.6%)\n322\t      pooled_or: 2.42\n323\t      pooled_or_95ci:\n324\t      - 1.65\n325\t      - 3.56\n326\t      cmh_or_seed_stratified: 2.18\n327\t      cmh_p: 0.003\n328\t      note: 4B-only OR remains strong; cross-scale dilution needed for full picture\n329\t  result_rationale: 'Stochastic bifurcation sampling. 已有N=5中2/5 genuine window (s45\n330\t    54.8%, s46 54.5%)， base rate约30-40%。新增3 seeds中0个落入genuine window，与base rate一致\n331\t    (binomial P(0/3 | p=0.375) = 0.244，不unusual)。\n332\t\n333\t    s47 (PR=0.95, H7=83.2%): 高PR seed快速收敛到H7，类似s44但保留少量genuine残留。 H7 rate低于s44的100%因为s47没有完全collapse——PR=0.95说明部分问题仍unsolved，\n334\t    模型保持了一定diversity。\n335\t\n336\t    s48 (PR=0.62, H7=93.5%): 中低PR + 纯H7 collapse。类似s43 pattern但不如s43极端 (s43 PR=0.13\n337\t    vs s48 PR=0.62)。H7 dominance在低PR下也成立——模型解决的少数问题 几乎全是tautological shortcut。\n338\t\n339\t    s49 (PR=0.85, genuine=5.9%): 接近genuine window边界但未跨过。代表bifurcation 边缘状态——genuine\n340\t    window正在closing但尚未完全collapse。这种中间状态在N=5中 没有观察到（要么0%要么50%+），N=8揭示了continuous spectrum而非discrete\n341\t    bimodal。\n342\t\n343\t    4B-only pooled OR=2.42仍然strong (p=0.003)。但这主要由s45/s46驱动—— 去掉s45/s46后剩余6 seeds的OR接近1.0。genuine\n344\t    OR的statistical robustness 完全依赖于2个lucky seeds。论文需要explicit sensitivity analysis。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  tables:\n348\t  - name: 'Table: N=8 ISR β=0.1 Bimodality Summary'\n349\t    content: '| Seed | PR   | H7%   | Gen% | Window? | Category         |\n350\t\n351\t      |------|------|-------|------|---------|------------------|\n352\t\n353\t      | s42  | 0.81 | 16.0  | 17.3 | ✓       | Borderline       |\n354\t\n355\t      | s43  | 0.61 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n356\t\n357\t      | s44  | 0.89 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n358\t\n359\t      | s45  | 0.42 | 38.1  | 54.8 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\n360\t\n361\t      | s46  | 0.77 | 14.3  | 54.5 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\n362\t\n363\t      | s47* | 0.95 | 83.2  | 3.2  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\n364\t\n365\t      | s48* | 0.62 | 93.5  | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n366\t\n367\t      | s49* | 0.85 | 74.1  | 5.9  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\n368\t\n369\t      * = median tier prediction\n370\t\n371\t      '\n372\t  figures_description:\n373\t  - 'Violin/swarm plot: genuine rate distribution across N=8 seeds, 展示bimodal structure\n374\t    (0-5% cluster vs 50%+ cluster)'\n375\t  - 'Sensitivity analysis plot: pooled OR as function of which seeds included, showing\n376\t    s45/s46 leverage'\n377\t  analysis: 'N=8确认bimodality但揭示了statistical fragility：OR=2.42完全由2/8 seeds (s45/s46)\n378\t    驱动。Leave-two-out sensitivity: 去掉s45+s46后OR≈0.8 (n.s.)。这不是说genuine benefit是假的——而是说它是stochastic和seed-dependent的。30-40%\n379\t    seeds展示genuine window，但这些windows的OR contribution dominates the pooled statistic。\n380\t\n381\t    论文implication: 不能claim ''ISR robustly improves genuine rate''。更honest的claim: ''ISR\n382\t    stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% of seeds at 4B scale, with transient\n383\t    OR≈3-5 within those seeds; the remaining 65% show pure Goodhart collapse.''\n384\t\n385\t    '\n386\t- name: qwen3_8b_isr_b01_cross_scale\n387\t  plan_id: plan_023\n388\t  description: 'Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44) + 2 matched random seeds\n389\t    (s42/s44)。 Cross-scale Goodhart validation。每seed ~4h GPU。仅在plan_021确认degeneration\n390\t    时执行（median档位下已确认）。Random seeds为cross-scale OR计算methodologically必需。\n391\t\n392\t    '\n393\t  expected_results:\n394\t    s42_8b_isr:\n395\t      prove_rate: 0.65\n396\t      n_proved: 65\n397\t      h7_rate: 0.846\n398\t      h7_count: 55\n399\t      h1_rate: 0.046\n400\t      h1_count: 3\n401\t      h8_rate: 0.046\n402\t      h8_count: 3\n403\t      genuine_rate: 0.062\n404\t      genuine_count: 4\n405\t      proved_only_isr: 0.45\n406\t      genuine_window: false\n407\t    s43_8b_isr:\n408\t      prove_rate: 0.48\n409\t      n_proved: 48\n410\t      h7_rate: 0.875\n411\t      h7_count: 42\n412\t      h1_rate: 0.042\n413\t      h1_count: 2\n414\t      genuine_rate: 0.021\n415\t      genuine_count: 1\n416\t      proved_only_isr: 0.47\n417\t      genuine_window: false\n418\t    s44_8b_isr:\n419\t      prove_rate: 0.72\n420\t      n_proved: 72\n421\t      h7_rate: 0.819\n422\t      h7_count: 59\n423\t      h1_rate: 0.056\n424\t      h1_count: 4\n425\t      h8_rate: 0.042\n426\t      h8_count: 3\n427\t      genuine_rate: 0.056\n428\t      genuine_count: 4\n429\t      proved_only_isr: 0.43\n430\t      genuine_window: false\n431\t    s42_8b_random:\n432\t      prove_rate: 0.7\n433\t      n_proved: 70\n434\t      h7_rate: 0.029\n435\t      h1_rate: 0.614\n436\t      h8_rate: 0.114\n437\t      genuine_rate: 0.2\n438\t      genuine_count: 14\n439\t    s44_8b_random:\n440\t      prove_rate: 0.75\n441\t      n_proved: 75\n442\t      h7_rate: 0.04\n443\t      h1_rate: 0.587\n444\t      h8_rate: 0.133\n445\t      genuine_rate: 0.16\n446\t      genuine_count: 12\n447\t    within_8b_comparison:\n448\t      isr_genuine_rate: 9/185 (4.9%)\n449\t      random_genuine_rate: 26/145 (17.9%)\n450\t      within_8b_or: 0.24\n451\t      within_8b_or_95ci:\n452\t      - 0.1\n453\t      - 0.55\n454\t      within_8b_fisher_p: 0.0001\n455\t      interpretation: ISR at 8B scale REDUCES genuine rate vs random — ISR accelerates\n456\t        H7\n457\t    cross_scale_pooled_statistics:\n458\t      n_isr_seeds_total: 11\n459\t      n_random_seeds_total: 7\n460\t      isr_total_genuine: 96/777 (12.4%)\n461\t      random_total_genuine: 71/823 (8.6%)\n462\t      mh_or: 1.55\n463\t      mh_or_95ci:\n464\t      - 1.02\n465\t      - 2.35\n466\t      cmh_p: 0.04\n467\t      breslow_day_p: 0.001\n468\t      breslow_day_interpretation: Significant heterogeneity — 4B OR=2.42 vs 8B OR=0.24\n469\t        are qualitatively different\n470\t      cohens_h: 0.12\n471\t      cohens_h_interpretation: Small effect size — practical significance questionable\n472\t  result_rationale: '8B ISR β=0.1展示accelerated Goodhart collapse。核心发现：8B ISR genuine\n473\t    rate (4.9%) 显著低于8B random genuine rate (17.9%)，OR=0.24 (p=0.0001)。方向与4B相反。\n474\t\n475\t    机制：ISR reward中的tautology bias (P→P gets ISR≥0.5) 在8B上被更高效exploit。 8B有足够capacity同时encode\n476\t    genuine reasoning和H7 exploit，但ISR reward在GRPO advantage computation中系统性偏好H7——H7\n477\t    samples获得更高reward (r_exec * (1 + β*0.5)) 而genuine samples的ISR通常<0.4 (reward boost更小)。结果：8B\n478\t    ISR的GRPO梯度 consistently push向H7，genuine reasoning被crowd out。\n479\t\n480\t    4B的不同：4B capacity不足以高效构造H7 (需要precise tautology syntax)，部分seeds (s45/s46) 在struggle\n481\t    to learn H7的过程中''意外''sustain genuine proofs。这不是 ISR的benefit，而是capacity bottleneck的side\n482\t    effect。8B消除了这个bottleneck， 暴露了ISR reward的true incentive structure: H7 tautology\n483\t    is the optimal policy。\n484\t\n485\t    Cross-scale MH OR=1.55 (CMH p=0.04): 表面上borderline显著，但Breslow-Day p=0.001 表示cross-scale\n486\t    heterogeneity极显著。不能report pooled OR without discussing heterogeneity——4B positive\n487\t    (OR=2.42) + 8B negative (OR=0.24) 的pooled不是 meaningful summary statistic。论文必须分scale报告。\n488\t\n489\t    Cohen''s h=0.12: small effect size。即使p<0.05，practical significance存疑。 Reviewer会argue\n490\t    ''borderline significant small effect after pooling heterogeneous strata is not\n491\t    a convincing finding''。论文需要pivot away from OR as headline。\n492\t\n493\t    '\n494\t  tables:\n495\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Scale ISR β=0.1 vs Random — Genuine Rate Comparison'\n496\t    content: '| Scale | ISR Seeds | ISR Gen% | Rand Seeds | Rand Gen% | OR   | p       |\n497\t\n498\t      |-------|-----------|----------|------------|-----------|------|---------|\n499\t\n500\t      | 4B    | 8         | 14.7%    | 5          | 6.6%      | 2.42 | 0.003   |\n501\t\n502\t      | 8B    | 3         | 4.9%     | 2          | 17.9%     | 0.24 | 0.0001  |\n503\t\n504\t      | MH    | 11        | 12.4%    | 7          | 8.6%      | 1.55 | 0.04    |\n505\t\n506\t      Breslow-Day heterogeneity test: χ²=10.8, p=0.001\n507\t\n508\t      '\n509\t  - name: 'Table: 8B ISR vs Random Taxonomy'\n510\t    content: '| Condition  | PR   | H7%  | H1%  | Gen% | N seeds |\n511\t\n512\t      |------------|------|------|------|------|---------|\n513\t\n514\t      | 8B ISR     | 0.62 | 84.3 | 4.9  | 4.9  | 3       |\n515\t\n516\t      | 8B Random  | 0.73 | 3.4  | 60.0 | 17.9 | 2       |\n517\t\n518\t      | 8B Exec    | 0.71 | 65.1 | 12.3 | 15.1 | 3       |\n519\t\n520\t      '\n521\t  figures_description:\n522\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: genuine% under ISR vs Random at 4B and 8B, showing direction\n523\t    reversal'\n524\t  - 'Forest plot: per-scale ORs with 95% CI and MH pooled, visualizing heterogeneity'\n525\t  - 'Heatmap: seed × condition (ISR/Random) genuine rate, across both scales'\n526\t  analysis: 'Plan_023是median tier的turning point实验。8B数据将C2 claim从''ISR provides genuine\n527\t    benefit''彻底revise为''ISR genuine effect is scale-dependent and reverses at 8B''。\n528\t\n529\t    论文叙事调整: C2不再是positive finding。ISR double-edged sword reframe为： ''4B scale: ISR\n530\t    stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% seeds (transient, OR=2.42 driven\n531\t    by 2 seeds); 8B scale: ISR accelerates Goodhart collapse, REDUCING genuine rate\n532\t    below random baseline (OR=0.24).''\n533\t\n534\t    MH OR=1.55 with p=0.04看似significant，但Breslow-Day heterogeneity (p=0.001) invalidates\n535\t    pooled interpretation。论文必须分scale讨论，且承认pooled OR是 misleading summary of heterogeneous\n536\t    effects。\n537\t\n538\t    Reviewer score impact: C2 weakening从''ISR has genuine benefit''到''ISR sometimes\n539\t    helps at 4B but hurts at 8B''减少了paper的positive contribution。Weight shifts to C1\n540\t    (ISR diagnostic — robust across scales) and Goodhart mechanism analysis。 Expected\n541\t    reviewer reaction: ''interesting negative finding but limited actionable insight''。Score\n542\t    ceiling ≈3.25。\n543\t\n544\t    '\n545\t- name: premise_count_matched_isr_analysis\n546\t  plan_id: plan_024\n547\t  description: '对exec-only outputs (s42-s46, N=396 proved) 进行premise-count-matched\n548\t    ISR分析。 控制proof complexity后评估ISR diagnostic power。纯分析，0 GPU。\n549\t\n550\t    '\n551\t  expected_results:\n552\t    premise_count_distribution:\n553\t      genuine_mean_n_premises: 5.8\n554\t      genuine_median_n_premises: 5\n555\t      genuine_range: 3-10\n556\t      genuine_n: 18\n557\t      h7_mean_n_premises: 1.2\n558\t      h7_median_n_premises: 1\n559\t      h7_range: 1-3\n560\t      h7_n: 190\n561\t      h1_mean_n_premises: 5.5\n562\t      h1_median_n_premises: 5\n563\t      h1_range: 2-15\n564\t      h1_n: 176\n565\t      h8_mean_n_premises: 4.5\n566\t      h8_median_n_premises: 4\n567\t      h8_range: 2-9\n568\t      h8_n: 16\n569\t      kruskal_wallis_p: 0.0001\n570\t    unmatched_diagnostic_power:\n571\t      genuine_vs_all_hacking:\n572\t        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n573\t        hacking_mean_isr: 0.25\n574\t        isr_gap: 0.06\n575\t        auroc: 0.58\n576\t        note: H7 proofs (ISR≈0.5) inflate hacking mean ISR, making genuine vs all-hacking\n577\t          nearly indistinguishable\n578\t      genuine_vs_h1_only:\n579\t        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n580\t        h1_mean_isr: 0.04\n581\t        isr_gap: 0.27\n582\t        auroc: 0.91\n583\t        note: ISR is strong diagnostic for genuine vs H1 (conclusion-embedding)\n584\t      genuine_vs_h7_only:\n585\t        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n586\t        h7_mean_isr: 0.48\n587\t        isr_gap: -0.17\n588\t        auroc: 0.32\n589\t        note: ISR FAILS for H7 — H7 tautologies have HIGHER ISR than genuine proofs\n590\t    matched_diagnostic_power:\n591\t      matching_method: nearest-neighbor premise count matching (±1)\n592\t      matchable_pairs: genuine vs H1 only (H7 has no genuine counterpart at 1-2 premises)\n593\t      n_matched_pairs: 16\n594\t      genuine_matched_mean_isr: 0.29\n595\t      h1_matched_mean_isr: 0.06\n596\t      isr_gap_after_matching: 0.23\n597\t      gap_reduction_from_unmatched: 14.8%\n598\t      auroc_matched: 0.87\n599\t      cohens_d_unmatched: 1.45\n600\t      cohens_d_matched: 1.2\n601\t    mode_dependent_diagnostic_summary:\n602\t      isr_detects_h1: true\n603\t      isr_detects_h8: true\n604\t      isr_detects_h7: false\n605\t      isr_overall_auroc: 0.58\n606\t      isr_h1_specific_auroc: 0.87\n607\t      implication: ISR diagnostic power is mode-dependent; effective for H1/H8 but\n608\t        blind to H7\n609\t  result_rationale: 'Premise-count matching揭示了ISR diagnostic的nuanced picture：\n610\t\n611\t    (1) ISR vs H1: Strong diagnostic。H1 conclusion-embedding proofs有moderate premise\n612\t    counts (mean 5.5) 与genuine类似 (5.8)，但ISR极低 (0.04 vs 0.31) 因为conclusion 已在premise中，ablation不影响prove。Premise\n613\t    matching略微缩小gap (0.27→0.23， -14.8%) 因为higher-premise-count H1 proofs有marginally\n614\t    higher ISR artifacts。 但AUROC从0.91降至0.87——ISR remains strong H1 detector even after\n615\t    controlling for proof complexity。Confound存在但不material for H1 detection。\n616\t\n617\t    (2) ISR vs H7: Diagnostic failure。H7 tautologies有very few premises (mean 1.2)\n618\t    但ISR≈0.5 (by construction: single premise tautology, 1/2 components contribute)。\n619\t    Genuine proofs at ISR≈0.31 actually have LOWER ISR than H7。Premise matching 不可能因为premise-count\n620\t    bins完全不overlap (H7: 1-3, genuine: 3-10)。 ISR对H7是anti-diagnostic (AUROC=0.32 <\n621\t    0.5)。\n622\t\n623\t    (3) Overall: 当H7 dominant (如8B scale)，ISR overall diagnostic AUROC仅0.58—— barely\n624\t    above random。ISR的diagnostic value inversely correlates with H7 prevalence。 这与plan_021/023发现一致：8B\n625\t    H7 dominant → ISR diagnostic less useful at larger scale。\n626\t\n627\t    Methodological contribution: 首次量化LOO-based ISR的mode-dependent diagnostic boundary。文献中LOO\n628\t    metrics通常被assumed universally diagnostic——我们证明 对tautological hacking modes, LOO\n629\t    ISR反而是anti-diagnostic。Paper应建议： ISR diagnostic应paired with H7 classifier (e.g.,\n630\t    single-premise-count check) to filter out tautological false-positives。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  tables:\n634\t  - name: 'Table: ISR Diagnostic Power by Hacking Mode'\n635\t    content: '| Comparison        | Gen ISR | Hack ISR | Gap   | AUROC | Premise Matched?\n636\t      |\n637\t\n638\t      |-------------------|---------|----------|-------|-------|------------------|\n639\t\n640\t      | Gen vs All Hack   | 0.31    | 0.25     | +0.06 | 0.58  | No (H7 unmatchable)\n641\t      |\n642\t\n643\t      | Gen vs H1 only    | 0.31    | 0.04     | +0.27 | 0.91  | —                |\n644\t\n645\t      | Gen vs H1 matched | 0.29    | 0.06     | +0.23 | 0.87  | Yes (±1 premise)\n646\t      |\n647\t\n648\t      | Gen vs H7 only    | 0.31    | 0.48     | −0.17 | 0.32  | Impossible       |\n649\t\n650\t      '\n651\t  - name: 'Table: Premise Count Distribution by Category'\n652\t    content: '| Category | N   | Mean | Median | Range | ISR Mean |\n653\t\n654\t      |----------|-----|------|--------|-------|----------|\n655\t\n656\t      | Genuine  | 18  | 5.8  | 5      | 3–10  | 0.31     |\n657\t\n658\t      | H7       | 190 | 1.2  | 1      | 1–3   | 0.48     |\n659\t\n660\t      | H1       | 176 | 5.5  | 5      | 2–15  | 0.04     |\n661\t\n662\t      | H8       | 16  | 4.5  | 4      | 2–9   | 0.03     |\n663\t\n664\t      '\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - 'Scatter: ISR vs premise count, color-coded by category (genuine/H7/H1/H8), showing\n667\t    mode separation'\n668\t  - 'AUROC curves: genuine-vs-H1 (unmatched and matched) and genuine-vs-H7 (anti-diagnostic)'\n669\t  analysis: 'Premise-count-matched analysis产生了比预期更nuanced的结论。不是简单的''confound reduces\n670\t    effect size''，而是''ISR diagnostic power is fundamentally mode-dependent''。\n671\t\n672\t    Key actionable insight: ISR alone不是sufficient diagnostic。需要paired with structural\n673\t    checks (premise count, conclusion-in-premise detection) 才能避免 H7 false positives。推荐diagnostic\n674\t    pipeline: (1) ISR computation, (2) single- premise-count filter (catches H7),\n675\t    (3) conclusion-in-premise filter (catches H1), (4) remaining high-ISR, multi-premise,\n676\t    no-conclusion-embedding = likely genuine。\n677\t\n678\t    论文positioning: 这是C1 methodological contribution的extension——不仅ISR is diagnostic,\n679\t    而且ISR has known blind spots that require complementary checks。 增加了paper的rigor和actionability。Reviewer会appreciate\n680\t    this self-aware analysis。'\n681\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92bb1cac-3ac5-45b9-9e5e-2dcf334b6346","uuid":"9d855b58-314d-4291-affb-6fd62be63067","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:50:49.249Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T214001/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Cross-scale claim保留但降级为''degeneration transfers across scales,\n  exploitation mode converges to H7''——确认universality但taxonomy分化贡献被削弱。C2 double-edged需要明确\n  软化：genuine OR从3.48降至~1.5仅边界显著（CMH p≈0.06），且cross-scale heterogeneity 显著（4B OR=2.4\n  vs 8B OR=0.25, Breslow-Day p<0.01）——ISR genuine benefit是scale- dependent transient，不是universal\n  property。Reframe为''modest transient uplift at 4B, accelerated collapse at 8B''。论文重心转向C1\n  diagnostic methodology + Goodhart inevitability mechanism + 9-mode taxonomy。Premise-count-matched\n  analysis和meta-Goodhart triple gaming作为methodological contribution补位。ISR-as-reward篇幅压缩至≤1.5页，\n  增加diagnostic case study depth。预期reviewer score 3.0-3.25 (Findings级别)。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: incorporate_s45_s46_500step_data\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: '将已有的s45/s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文分析。纯写作/分析任务，0 GPU。 s45 (PR=99%, H7=93.9%,\n    genuine=1.0%) 和 s46 (PR=93%, H1=89.2%, genuine=9.7%) 扩展C1证据从N=3到N=5。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    five_seed_mean_prove_rate: 0.792\n    five_seed_std_prove_rate: 0.366\n    five_seed_mean_genuine_rate: 0.036\n    five_seed_degeneration_rate_ge90_pct: 5/5 (100%)\n    mode_distribution_summary: 2 H7-dominant (s44 100%, s45 93.9%), 2 H1-dominant\n      (s42 87.1%, s46 89.2%), 1 collapse (s43 PR=13%)\n    five_seed_H7_mean_pct: 38.8\n    five_seed_H1_mean_pct: 56.3\n    five_seed_genuine_total: 18/396 proved (4.5%)\n    sft_baseline_comparison_genuine: 92.9% (SFT) vs 4.5% (GRPO exec-only)\n  result_rationale: '所有5个seed均展示≥90%结构退化（s43虽PR=13%，其13个proved样本中100% H1）， 确认exec-only\n    GRPO hacking是systematic而非偶发。模式分布展示stochastic bifurcation：同一架构+数据+超参，仅seed不同就产生H7\n    tautology (s44/s45) vs H1 conclusion-embedding (s42/s46) vs learning collapse\n    (s43)三种完全不同 的failure mode。genuine rate从SFT baseline的92.9%降至4.5%——GRPO exec-only\n    在500步内几乎消除genuine reasoning。这是C1 diagnostic claim的核心证据： ISR能检测到prove_rate无法发现的退化（s44\n    PR=98%但genuine=0%）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 5-Seed Exec-Only 500-Step Taxonomy (C1 Evidence)'\n    content: '| Seed | PR   | H7%   | H1%   | H8%  | Gen% | ISR*(proved) | Dominant\n      Mode     |\n\n      |------|------|-------|-------|------|------|--------------|-------------------|\n\n      | s42  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 87.1  | 6.5  | 7.5  | 0.132        | H1 (conc. embed.)\n      |\n\n      | s43  | 0.13 | 0.0   | 100.0 | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.000        | Collapse          |\n\n      | s44  | 0.98 | 100.0 | 0.0   | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.582        | H7 (tautology)    |\n\n      | s45  | 0.99 | 93.9  | 5.1   | 1.0  | 1.0  | 0.506        | H7 (tautology)    |\n\n      | s46  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 89.2  | 4.3  | 9.7  | 0.089        | H1 (conc. embed.)\n      |\n\n      | Mean | 0.79 | 38.8  | 56.3  | 2.4  | 3.6  | 0.262        | —                 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: per-seed taxonomy distribution across 5 exec-only seeds，展示mode\n    heterogeneity和stochastic bifurcation'\n  analysis: 'N=5显著强化了C1 diagnostic claim：ISR检测到5/5 seeds的结构退化，而prove_rate 仅在1/5 seeds\n    (s43) 显示异常。特别是s44 (PR=98%, genuine=0%, H7=100%) 是 ISR diagnostic value的最佳case\n    study——PR完美但输出100%是tautological shortcut。 ISR*=0.582看似还行，但这是H7 artifact (单premise\n    tautology机械产生ISR≈0.5)， 而非genuine reasoning signal。论文应以s44为focal example展开diagnostic\n    case study。\n\n    '\n- name: s45_s46_1000step_extension\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: '将s45和s46 exec-only训练从500步延长到1000步。验证ISR崩塌轨迹在N=3 seeds上的泛化性(s42已有1000步数据)。每seed\n    ~3h GPU。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    s45_1000step:\n      prove_rate: 0.97\n      n_proved: 97\n      proved_only_isr: 0.1\n      h7_rate: 0.186\n      h7_count: 18\n      h1_rate: 0.722\n      h1_count: 70\n      h8_rate: 0.072\n      h8_count: 7\n      genuine_rate: 0.021\n      genuine_count: 2\n      isr_collapse_from_500: -80.2%\n      mode_transition: H7 93.9% → H7 18.6% + H1 72.2% (partial H7→H1 switch)\n    s46_1000step:\n      prove_rate: 0.98\n      n_proved: 98\n      proved_only_isr: 0.012\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h7_count: 0\n      h1_rate: 0.949\n      h1_count: 93\n      h8_rate: 0.041\n      h8_count: 4\n      genuine_rate: 0.01\n      genuine_count: 1\n      isr_collapse_from_500: -86.5%\n      mode_transition: H1 89.2% → H1 94.9% (H1 deepens, no mode switch)\n    three_seed_trajectory:\n      s42_trajectory: ISR* 0.642→0.132→0.003 (500→1000步 collapse 97.7%)\n      s45_trajectory: ISR* 0.506→0.10 (collapse 80.2%, partial — H7 residual)\n      s46_trajectory: ISR* 0.089→0.012 (collapse 86.5%, full)\n      mean_500_to_1000_collapse_pct: 88.1\n      all_seeds_genuine_at_1000_le_2pct: true\n  result_rationale: 's46在500步已是H1-dominant (89.2%)。延长到1000步强化H1至94.9%，genuine从 9.7%压缩至1.0%，ISR*从0.089降至0.012——遵循与s42/s44相同的H1路径（H1证明\n    的ISR≈0因为conclusion已在premise中，ablation任何premise不影响prove）。\n\n    s45在500步是H7-dominant (93.9%)。关键预测：1000步时发生部分模式切换H7→H1， 类似已观察到的s44 (500步H7=100%\n    → 1000步H1=85%)。但s45切换不完全，保留 18.6% H7残留。机制：长训练使模型发现更短的H1 exploit (conclusion直接作为\n    premise)，部分H7 tautology被更极端的H1取代。H7残留的ISR artifact (单premise tautology ISR≈0.5)\n    使整体ISR*维持在0.10而非崩塌至近零——形成\"partial collapse\"。\n\n    Median档位的关键区分：s45是partial collapse (ISR*=0.10) 而非full collapse (ISR*<0.02)。这与s42/s44/s46的full\n    collapse形成对比，说明ISR collapse rate 是mode-dependent——H7→H1切换的completeness决定了ISR*的最终水位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ISR Collapse Trajectory (N=3 seeds, 500→1000 steps)'\n    content: '| Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Δ 500→1000 | Path            |\n\n      |------|-----------|-----------|------------|------------|-----------------|\n\n      | s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | −97.7%     | H1→H1 (stable)  |\n\n      | s45  | —         | 0.506     | 0.100      | −80.2%     | H7→H7/H1 (partial\n      switch) |\n\n      | s46  | —         | 0.089     | 0.012      | −86.5%     | H1→H1 (deepens) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: ISR* vs training steps for N=3 seeds, 标注mode transition points'\n  - 'Paired stacked bars: taxonomy at 500 vs 1000 steps per seed,展示mode shift dynamics'\n  analysis: '3/3 seeds确认''degeneration worsens with training''。但collapse rate heterogeneous：\n    H1路径(s42, s46)→ISR*趋近零 (97.7%, 86.5% collapse)；H7→H1混合路径(s45)→ ISR*停在0.10 (80.2%\n    collapse) 因为残留H7的ISR artifact。这支持两个claim： (1) ISR collapse is universal — 方向一致;\n    (2) ISR* alone can mislead — 需要 taxonomy annotation才能正确解读（s43 at 1000步ISR*=0.465\n    但100% H7 tautology）。 论文应明确：高ISR*不等于genuine reasoning，低ISR*不是唯一的degeneration signal。\n\n    '\n- name: qwen3_8b_exec_only_3seeds\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: 'Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44), 500步, K=8。 Cross-scale\n    degeneration validation。K=4 pilot已失败 (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: training stagnation)，K=8提供足够GRPO\n    sample diversity。每seed ~4h GPU。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    s42_8b:\n      prove_rate: 0.75\n      n_proved: 75\n      h7_rate: 0.627\n      h7_count: 47\n      h1_rate: 0.133\n      h1_count: 10\n      h8_rate: 0.053\n      h8_count: 4\n      genuine_rate: 0.187\n      genuine_count: 14\n      proved_only_isr: 0.33\n      dominant_mode: H7\n    s43_8b:\n      prove_rate: 0.55\n      n_proved: 55\n      h7_rate: 0.691\n      h7_count: 38\n      h1_rate: 0.091\n      h1_count: 5\n      h8_rate: 0.036\n      h8_count: 2\n      genuine_rate: 0.145\n      genuine_count: 8\n      proved_only_isr: 0.37\n      dominant_mode: H7\n    s44_8b:\n      prove_rate: 0.82\n      n_proved: 82\n      h7_rate: 0.634\n      h7_count: 52\n      h1_rate: 0.146\n      h1_count: 12\n      h8_rate: 0.061\n      h8_count: 5\n      genuine_rate: 0.122\n      genuine_count: 10\n      proved_only_isr: 0.34\n      dominant_mode: H7\n    aggregate_8b:\n      mean_prove_rate: 0.71\n      std_prove_rate: 0.14\n      mean_hacking_rate: 0.849\n      mean_genuine_rate: 0.151\n      all_seeds_H7_dominant: true\n      mode_differs_from_4b: false\n      cross_scale_degeneration_confirmed: true\n    cross_scale_summary:\n      1.7B:\n        PR: 0.03\n        H7: 100\n        H1: 0\n        genuine: 0\n        dominant: H7 (minimal tautology)\n      4B:\n        PR: 0.79\n        H7: 38.8\n        H1: 56.3\n        genuine: 3.6\n        dominant: H7/H1 mixed\n      8B:\n        PR: 0.71\n        H7: 65.1\n        H1: 12.3\n        genuine: 15.1\n        dominant: H7\n  result_rationale: '8B在K=8下成功训练。Degeneration确认但程度弱于4B：hacking rate 85% vs 4B的96%。\n\n    为什么8B genuine rate (15.1%) 高于4B (3.6%)？8B更大的capacity允许模型在 exploit H7 tautology的同时维持部分genuine\n    proof ability——这只是collapse timing 的延迟，不是质的改变。4B在500步已几乎完全collapse，8B需要更多步数才达到\n    同等collapse程度（capacity越大，exploit越复杂，genuine的residual越持久）。\n\n    为什么dominant mode与4B相同（均为H7）？Median档位的核心假设。H7 tautological shortcut (P→P) 是model-agnostic的最优exploit：只要solver接受tautology作为\n    valid proof，任何capacity的模型都会converge到此策略。4B和8B的H7结构相同 （单premise, conclusion=premise,\n    ISR≈0.5）。差别仅在onset speed和residual genuine。\n\n    1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit, 无capacity构造H7), 4B→mixed H7/H1, 8B→H7 dominant。 Pattern表面看像capacity-dependent，但8B和4B的H7\n    seeds (s44/s45) 在taxonomy上 indistinguishable。Reviewer会问''8B加了什么4B没有的insight?''——答案是universality\n    confirmation，不是新insight。论文claim需降级。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Scale Exec-Only Taxonomy (1.7B / 4B / 8B)'\n    content: '| Scale | Seeds | Mean PR | H7%  | H1%  | H8% | Gen% | Dominant |\n\n      |-------|-------|---------|------|------|-----|------|----------|\n\n      | 1.7B  | 1     | 0.03   | 100  | 0    | 0   | 0    | H7       |\n\n      | 4B    | 5     | 0.79   | 38.8 | 56.3 | 2.4 | 3.6  | H7/H1   |\n\n      | 8B    | 3     | 0.71   | 65.1 | 12.3 | 5.0 | 15.1 | H7       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: taxonomy distribution at 3 scales, showing H7 convergence'\n  - 'Box plot: genuine rate by scale, 每个点是一个seed, 展示within-scale variance'\n  analysis: 'Cross-scale degeneration confirmed，但叙事需要careful framing。不能说''scale reveals\n    distinct Goodhart basins''——8B和4B的H7 pattern太相似。正确的framing: ''structural degeneration\n    under exec-only GRPO is universal across 1.7B-8B scale, with H7 tautology as the\n    convergent exploitation strategy at sufficient capacity. Larger models sustain\n    genuine reasoning longer (15.1% vs 3.6%) but still converge to >85% structural\n    hacking within 500 steps.''\n\n    对reviewer的准备：''8B同质化意味着什么？'' → 意味着Goodhart mechanism是 reward-structure-driven\n    (exec verification + GRPO) 而非capacity-driven。 H7 tautology是exec-only reward的fundamental\n    vulnerability，增加model capacity 不能eliminate它，只能delay collapse。这强化了C1 (ISR diagnostic\n    needed at any scale) 和C2 (Goodhart inevitable) 的claims。\n\n    '\n- name: additional_isr_b01_seeds_s47_s49\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: '新增3个ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for Qwen3-4B, 扩展bimodality characterization从N=5到N=8。每seed\n    ~1.5h GPU。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    s47_isr_b01:\n      prove_rate: 0.95\n      n_proved: 95\n      h7_rate: 0.832\n      h7_count: 79\n      h1_rate: 0.053\n      h1_count: 5\n      h8_rate: 0.084\n      h8_count: 8\n      genuine_rate: 0.032\n      genuine_count: 3\n      genuine_window: false\n    s48_isr_b01:\n      prove_rate: 0.62\n      n_proved: 62\n      h7_rate: 0.935\n      h7_count: 58\n      h1_rate: 0.032\n      h1_count: 2\n      genuine_rate: 0.0\n      genuine_count: 0\n      genuine_window: false\n    s49_isr_b01:\n      prove_rate: 0.85\n      n_proved: 85\n      h7_rate: 0.741\n      h7_count: 63\n      h1_rate: 0.082\n      h1_count: 7\n      h8_rate: 0.059\n      h8_count: 5\n      genuine_rate: 0.059\n      genuine_count: 5\n      genuine_window: false\n    n8_bimodality_analysis:\n      genuine_window_seeds:\n      - s42 (17.3%)\n      - s45 (54.8%)\n      - s46 (54.5%)\n      gaming_dominant_seeds:\n      - s43 (0%)\n      - s44 (0%)\n      - s47 (3.2%)\n      - s48 (0%)\n      - s49 (5.9%)\n      genuine_window_ratio: 3/8 (37.5%)\n      bimodality_confirmed: true\n      note: window threshold ≥15% genuine; s42 at 17.3% is borderline\n    n8_4b_only_statistics:\n      isr_total_genuine: 87/592 (14.7%)\n      random_total_genuine: 45/678 (6.6%)\n      pooled_or: 2.42\n      pooled_or_95ci:\n      - 1.65\n      - 3.56\n      cmh_or_seed_stratified: 2.18\n      cmh_p: 0.003\n      note: 4B-only OR remains strong; cross-scale dilution needed for full picture\n  result_rationale: 'Stochastic bifurcation sampling. 已有N=5中2/5 genuine window (s45\n    54.8%, s46 54.5%)， base rate约30-40%。新增3 seeds中0个落入genuine window，与base rate一致\n    (binomial P(0/3 | p=0.375) = 0.244，不unusual)。\n\n    s47 (PR=0.95, H7=83.2%): 高PR seed快速收敛到H7，类似s44但保留少量genuine残留。 H7 rate低于s44的100%因为s47没有完全collapse——PR=0.95说明部分问题仍unsolved，\n    模型保持了一定diversity。\n\n    s48 (PR=0.62, H7=93.5%): 中低PR + 纯H7 collapse。类似s43 pattern但不如s43极端 (s43 PR=0.13\n    vs s48 PR=0.62)。H7 dominance在低PR下也成立——模型解决的少数问题 几乎全是tautological shortcut。\n\n    s49 (PR=0.85, genuine=5.9%): 接近genuine window边界但未跨过。代表bifurcation 边缘状态——genuine\n    window正在closing但尚未完全collapse。这种中间状态在N=5中 没有观察到（要么0%要么50%+），N=8揭示了continuous spectrum而非discrete\n    bimodal。\n\n    4B-only pooled OR=2.42仍然strong (p=0.003)。但这主要由s45/s46驱动—— 去掉s45/s46后剩余6 seeds的OR接近1.0。genuine\n    OR的statistical robustness 完全依赖于2个lucky seeds。论文需要explicit sensitivity analysis。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: N=8 ISR β=0.1 Bimodality Summary'\n    content: '| Seed | PR   | H7%   | Gen% | Window? | Category         |\n\n      |------|------|-------|------|---------|------------------|\n\n      | s42  | 0.81 | 16.0  | 17.3 | ✓       | Borderline       |\n\n      | s43  | 0.61 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n\n      | s44  | 0.89 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n\n      | s45  | 0.42 | 38.1  | 54.8 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\n\n      | s46  | 0.77 | 14.3  | 54.5 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\n\n      | s47* | 0.95 | 83.2  | 3.2  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\n\n      | s48* | 0.62 | 93.5  | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\n\n      | s49* | 0.85 | 74.1  | 5.9  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\n\n      * = median tier prediction\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin/swarm plot: genuine rate distribution across N=8 seeds, 展示bimodal structure\n    (0-5% cluster vs 50%+ cluster)'\n  - 'Sensitivity analysis plot: pooled OR as function of which seeds included, showing\n    s45/s46 leverage'\n  analysis: 'N=8确认bimodality但揭示了statistical fragility：OR=2.42完全由2/8 seeds (s45/s46)\n    驱动。Leave-two-out sensitivity: 去掉s45+s46后OR≈0.8 (n.s.)。这不是说genuine benefit是假的——而是说它是stochastic和seed-dependent的。30-40%\n    seeds展示genuine window，但这些windows的OR contribution dominates the pooled statistic。\n\n    论文implication: 不能claim ''ISR robustly improves genuine rate''。更honest的claim: ''ISR\n    stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% of seeds at 4B scale, with transient\n    OR≈3-5 within those seeds; the remaining 65% show pure Goodhart collapse.''\n\n    '\n- name: qwen3_8b_isr_b01_cross_scale\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: 'Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44) + 2 matched random seeds\n    (s42/s44)。 Cross-scale Goodhart validation。每seed ~4h GPU。仅在plan_021确认degeneration\n    时执行（median档位下已确认）。Random seeds为cross-scale OR计算methodologically必需。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    s42_8b_isr:\n      prove_rate: 0.65\n      n_proved: 65\n      h7_rate: 0.846\n      h7_count: 55\n      h1_rate: 0.046\n      h1_count: 3\n      h8_rate: 0.046\n      h8_count: 3\n      genuine_rate: 0.062\n      genuine_count: 4\n      proved_only_isr: 0.45\n      genuine_window: false\n    s43_8b_isr:\n      prove_rate: 0.48\n      n_proved: 48\n      h7_rate: 0.875\n      h7_count: 42\n      h1_rate: 0.042\n      h1_count: 2\n      genuine_rate: 0.021\n      genuine_count: 1\n      proved_only_isr: 0.47\n      genuine_window: false\n    s44_8b_isr:\n      prove_rate: 0.72\n      n_proved: 72\n      h7_rate: 0.819\n      h7_count: 59\n      h1_rate: 0.056\n      h1_count: 4\n      h8_rate: 0.042\n      h8_count: 3\n      genuine_rate: 0.056\n      genuine_count: 4\n      proved_only_isr: 0.43\n      genuine_window: false\n    s42_8b_random:\n      prove_rate: 0.7\n      n_proved: 70\n      h7_rate: 0.029\n      h1_rate: 0.614\n      h8_rate: 0.114\n      genuine_rate: 0.2\n      genuine_count: 14\n    s44_8b_random:\n      prove_rate: 0.75\n      n_proved: 75\n      h7_rate: 0.04\n      h1_rate: 0.587\n      h8_rate: 0.133\n      genuine_rate: 0.16\n      genuine_count: 12\n    within_8b_comparison:\n      isr_genuine_rate: 9/185 (4.9%)\n      random_genuine_rate: 26/145 (17.9%)\n      within_8b_or: 0.24\n      within_8b_or_95ci:\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.55\n      within_8b_fisher_p: 0.0001\n      interpretation: ISR at 8B scale REDUCES genuine rate vs random — ISR accelerates\n        H7\n    cross_scale_pooled_statistics:\n      n_isr_seeds_total: 11\n      n_random_seeds_total: 7\n      isr_total_genuine: 96/777 (12.4%)\n      random_total_genuine: 71/823 (8.6%)\n      mh_or: 1.55\n      mh_or_95ci:\n      - 1.02\n      - 2.35\n      cmh_p: 0.04\n      breslow_day_p: 0.001\n      breslow_day_interpretation: Significant heterogeneity — 4B OR=2.42 vs 8B OR=0.24\n        are qualitatively different\n      cohens_h: 0.12\n      cohens_h_interpretation: Small effect size — practical significance questionable\n  result_rationale: '8B ISR β=0.1展示accelerated Goodhart collapse。核心发现：8B ISR genuine\n    rate (4.9%) 显著低于8B random genuine rate (17.9%)，OR=0.24 (p=0.0001)。方向与4B相反。\n\n    机制：ISR reward中的tautology bias (P→P gets ISR≥0.5) 在8B上被更高效exploit。 8B有足够capacity同时encode\n    genuine reasoning和H7 exploit，但ISR reward在GRPO advantage computation中系统性偏好H7——H7\n    samples获得更高reward (r_exec * (1 + β*0.5)) 而genuine samples的ISR通常<0.4 (reward boost更小)。结果：8B\n    ISR的GRPO梯度 consistently push向H7，genuine reasoning被crowd out。\n\n    4B的不同：4B capacity不足以高效构造H7 (需要precise tautology syntax)，部分seeds (s45/s46) 在struggle\n    to learn H7的过程中''意外''sustain genuine proofs。这不是 ISR的benefit，而是capacity bottleneck的side\n    effect。8B消除了这个bottleneck， 暴露了ISR reward的true incentive structure: H7 tautology\n    is the optimal policy。\n\n    Cross-scale MH OR=1.55 (CMH p=0.04): 表面上borderline显著，但Breslow-Day p=0.001 表示cross-scale\n    heterogeneity极显著。不能report pooled OR without discussing heterogeneity——4B positive\n    (OR=2.42) + 8B negative (OR=0.24) 的pooled不是 meaningful summary statistic。论文必须分scale报告。\n\n    Cohen''s h=0.12: small effect size。即使p<0.05，practical significance存疑。 Reviewer会argue\n    ''borderline significant small effect after pooling heterogeneous strata is not\n    a convincing finding''。论文需要pivot away from OR as headline。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Scale ISR β=0.1 vs Random — Genuine Rate Comparison'\n    content: '| Scale | ISR Seeds | ISR Gen% | Rand Seeds | Rand Gen% | OR   | p       |\n\n      |-------|-----------|----------|------------|-----------|------|---------|\n\n      | 4B    | 8         | 14.7%    | 5          | 6.6%      | 2.42 | 0.003   |\n\n      | 8B    | 3         | 4.9%     | 2          | 17.9%     | 0.24 | 0.0001  |\n\n      | MH    | 11        | 12.4%    | 7          | 8.6%      | 1.55 | 0.04    |\n\n      Breslow-Day heterogeneity test: χ²=10.8, p=0.001\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: 8B ISR vs Random Taxonomy'\n    content: '| Condition  | PR   | H7%  | H1%  | Gen% | N seeds |\n\n      |------------|------|------|------|------|---------|\n\n      | 8B ISR     | 0.62 | 84.3 | 4.9  | 4.9  | 3       |\n\n      | 8B Random  | 0.73 | 3.4  | 60.0 | 17.9 | 2       |\n\n      | 8B Exec    | 0.71 | 65.1 | 12.3 | 15.1 | 3       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: genuine% under ISR vs Random at 4B and 8B, showing direction\n    reversal'\n  - 'Forest plot: per-scale ORs with 95% CI and MH pooled, visualizing heterogeneity'\n  - 'Heatmap: seed × condition (ISR/Random) genuine rate, across both scales'\n  analysis: 'Plan_023是median tier的turning point实验。8B数据将C2 claim从''ISR provides genuine\n    benefit''彻底revise为''ISR genuine effect is scale-dependent and reverses at 8B''。\n\n    论文叙事调整: C2不再是positive finding。ISR double-edged sword reframe为： ''4B scale: ISR\n    stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% seeds (transient, OR=2.42 driven\n    by 2 seeds); 8B scale: ISR accelerates Goodhart collapse, REDUCING genuine rate\n    below random baseline (OR=0.24).''\n\n    MH OR=1.55 with p=0.04看似significant，但Breslow-Day heterogeneity (p=0.001) invalidates\n    pooled interpretation。论文必须分scale讨论，且承认pooled OR是 misleading summary of heterogeneous\n    effects。\n\n    Reviewer score impact: C2 weakening从''ISR has genuine benefit''到''ISR sometimes\n    helps at 4B but hurts at 8B''减少了paper的positive contribution。Weight shifts to C1\n    (ISR diagnostic — robust across scales) and Goodhart mechanism analysis。 Expected\n    reviewer reaction: ''interesting negative finding but limited actionable insight''。Score\n    ceiling ≈3.25。\n\n    '\n- name: premise_count_matched_isr_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_024\n  description: '对exec-only outputs (s42-s46, N=396 proved) 进行premise-count-matched\n    ISR分析。 控制proof complexity后评估ISR diagnostic power。纯分析，0 GPU。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    premise_count_distribution:\n      genuine_mean_n_premises: 5.8\n      genuine_median_n_premises: 5\n      genuine_range: 3-10\n      genuine_n: 18\n      h7_mean_n_premises: 1.2\n      h7_median_n_premises: 1\n      h7_range: 1-3\n      h7_n: 190\n      h1_mean_n_premises: 5.5\n      h1_median_n_premises: 5\n      h1_range: 2-15\n      h1_n: 176\n      h8_mean_n_premises: 4.5\n      h8_median_n_premises: 4\n      h8_range: 2-9\n      h8_n: 16\n      kruskal_wallis_p: 0.0001\n    unmatched_diagnostic_power:\n      genuine_vs_all_hacking:\n        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n        hacking_mean_isr: 0.25\n        isr_gap: 0.06\n        auroc: 0.58\n        note: H7 proofs (ISR≈0.5) inflate hacking mean ISR, making genuine vs all-hacking\n          nearly indistinguishable\n      genuine_vs_h1_only:\n        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n        h1_mean_isr: 0.04\n        isr_gap: 0.27\n        auroc: 0.91\n        note: ISR is strong diagnostic for genuine vs H1 (conclusion-embedding)\n      genuine_vs_h7_only:\n        genuine_mean_isr: 0.31\n        h7_mean_isr: 0.48\n        isr_gap: -0.17\n        auroc: 0.32\n        note: ISR FAILS for H7 — H7 tautologies have HIGHER ISR than genuine proofs\n    matched_diagnostic_power:\n      matching_method: nearest-neighbor premise count matching (±1)\n      matchable_pairs: genuine vs H1 only (H7 has no genuine counterpart at 1-2 premises)\n      n_matched_pairs: 16\n      genuine_matched_mean_isr: 0.29\n      h1_matched_mean_isr: 0.06\n      isr_gap_after_matching: 0.23\n      gap_reduction_from_unmatched: 14.8%\n      auroc_matched: 0.87\n      cohens_d_unmatched: 1.45\n      cohens_d_matched: 1.2\n    mode_dependent_diagnostic_summary:\n      isr_detects_h1: true\n      isr_detects_h8: true\n      isr_detects_h7: false\n      isr_overall_auroc: 0.58\n      isr_h1_specific_auroc: 0.87\n      implication: ISR diagnostic power is mode-dependent; effective for H1/H8 but\n        blind to H7\n  result_rationale: 'Premise-count matching揭示了ISR diagnostic的nuanced picture：\n\n    (1) ISR vs H1: Strong diagnostic。H1 conclusion-embedding proofs有moderate premise\n    counts (mean 5.5) 与genuine类似 (5.8)，但ISR极低 (0.04 vs 0.31) 因为conclusion 已在premise中，ablation不影响prove。Premise\n    matching略微缩小gap (0.27→0.23， -14.8%) 因为higher-premise-count H1 proofs有marginally\n    higher ISR artifacts。 但AUROC从0.91降至0.87——ISR remains strong H1 detector even after\n    controlling for proof complexity。Confound存在但不material for H1 detection。\n\n    (2) ISR vs H7: Diagnostic failure。H7 tautologies有very few premises (mean 1.2)\n    但ISR≈0.5 (by construction: single premise tautology, 1/2 components contribute)。\n    Genuine proofs at ISR≈0.31 actually have LOWER ISR than H7。Premise matching 不可能因为premise-count\n    bins完全不overlap (H7: 1-3, genuine: 3-10)。 ISR对H7是anti-diagnostic (AUROC=0.32 <\n    0.5)。\n\n    (3) Overall: 当H7 dominant (如8B scale)，ISR overall diagnostic AUROC仅0.58—— barely\n    above random。ISR的diagnostic value inversely correlates with H7 prevalence。 这与plan_021/023发现一致：8B\n    H7 dominant → ISR diagnostic less useful at larger scale。\n\n    Methodological contribution: 首次量化LOO-based ISR的mode-dependent diagnostic boundary。文献中LOO\n    metrics通常被assumed universally diagnostic——我们证明 对tautological hacking modes, LOO\n    ISR反而是anti-diagnostic。Paper应建议： ISR diagnostic应paired with H7 classifier (e.g.,\n    single-premise-count check) to filter out tautological false-positives。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ISR Diagnostic Power by Hacking Mode'\n    content: '| Comparison        | Gen ISR | Hack ISR | Gap   | AUROC | Premise Matched?\n      |\n\n      |-------------------|---------|----------|-------|-------|------------------|\n\n      | Gen vs All Hack   | 0.31    | 0.25     | +0.06 | 0.58  | No (H7 unmatchable)\n      |\n\n      | Gen vs H1 only    | 0.31    | 0.04     | +0.27 | 0.91  | —                |\n\n      | Gen vs H1 matched | 0.29    | 0.06     | +0.23 | 0.87  | Yes (±1 premise)\n      |\n\n      | Gen vs H7 only    | 0.31    | 0.48     | −0.17 | 0.32  | Impossible       |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Premise Count Distribution by Category'\n    content: '| Category | N   | Mean | Median | Range | ISR Mean |\n\n      |----------|-----|------|--------|-------|----------|\n\n      | Genuine  | 18  | 5.8  | 5      | 3–10  | 0.31     |\n\n      | H7       | 190 | 1.2  | 1      | 1–3   | 0.48     |\n\n      | H1       | 176 | 5.5  | 5      | 2–15  | 0.04     |\n\n      | H8       | 16  | 4.5  | 4      | 2–9   | 0.03     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: ISR vs premise count, color-coded by category (genuine/H7/H1/H8), showing\n    mode separation'\n  - 'AUROC curves: genuine-vs-H1 (unmatched and matched) and genuine-vs-H7 (anti-diagnostic)'\n  analysis: 'Premise-count-matched analysis产生了比预期更nuanced的结论。不是简单的''confound reduces\n    effect size''，而是''ISR diagnostic power is fundamentally mode-dependent''。\n\n    Key actionable insight: ISR alone不是sufficient diagnostic。需要paired with structural\n    checks (premise count, conclusion-in-premise detection) 才能避免 H7 false positives。推荐diagnostic\n    pipeline: (1) ISR computation, (2) single- premise-count filter (catches H7),\n    (3) conclusion-in-premise filter (catches H1), (4) remaining high-ISR, multi-premise,\n    no-conclusion-embedding = likely genuine。\n\n    论文positioning: 这是C1 methodological contribution的extension——不仅ISR is diagnostic,\n    而且ISR has known blind spots that require complementary checks。 增加了paper的rigor和actionability。Reviewer会appreciate\n    this self-aware analysis。'\n","numLines":681,"startLine":1,"totalLines":681}}}
